    + Body

            {"products":[{"id":"ch3_7f2a9c1e","title":"Trail Running Vest 5L","brand":"Salomon","image":"https://images.example.com/vest.jpg","price":59.99,"currency":"USD","retailer":"rei.com","retailers":4,"commission":0.08}]}


+ Response 502 (application/json)

        Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.

    + Attributes (Error)


    + Body

            {"error":"PayPal isn't configured on this server."}


+ Response 503 (application/json)

        Gemini, PayPal or Channel3 failed or isn't configured.

    + Attributes (Error)


