## Api Shops Orders Refund 409 Error1 (object)


### Properties
+ `error` (string, required) - A sentence you can show to a person.
+ `field` (string, optional) - The form field at fault, when there is one.
+ `detail` (string, optional) - The upstream service's own message, for debugging.
+ `refundInPayPal` (boolean, optional) - Refund it in PayPal yourself, then call again with `record: true`.


## Api Shops Orders Refund Request (object)


### Properties
+ `record`: `false` (boolean, optional) - `true`: don't contact PayPal, just record that the seller refunded it themselves.


## Api Shops Orders Refund Response (object)


### Properties
+ `ok` (boolean, required) 
+ `refundId` (string, optional, nullable) - PayPal's refund id; null when `record` was used.


## Api Shops Orders Ship Request (object)


### Properties
+ `carrier` (enum[string], required) 
    + `USPS`
    + `UPS`
    + `FEDEX`
    + `DHL`
    + `OTHER`
+ `carrierName` (string, optional) - Required when `carrier` is `OTHER`.
+ `trackingNumber` (string, required) 


## Api Shops Orders Ship Response (object)


### Properties
+ `ok` (boolean, required) 
+ `synced` (boolean, required) - Whether PayPal accepted the tracking number.


